   "urlId": "free-and-less-expensive-ways-to-get-help-with-sage-mas-90-mas-200",
   "title": "Free and Less Expensive Ways to Get Help with Sage MAS 90 / MAS 200",
   "sourceUrl": "",
   "body": "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1673028036940\" id=\"item-62d9abbb9a630f3a59048f13\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-border-radii=\"&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-b160e70b62f58350046e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Frequently every Sage MAS 90 / MAS 200 consultant gets contacted asking for free help. Either they or their employer is unwilling to spend money on their ERP solution or getting help. Maybe they’ve had a bad experience with a previous consultant or they’ve gone over budget or just short on cash (or cheap).There are many solutions out there for individuals looking for help with their Sage MAS 90 or MAS 200.1. The best place to look for free help is The Sage MAS 90 and 200 Community (<a href=\"http://community.sagemas.com/sagemas/?category.id=SageMAS90-200\">http://community.sagemas.com/sagemas/?category.id=SageMAS90-200</a>) </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-code code-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/147086af-c803-4086-8ad4-958c4388b836_1125/website.components.code.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/147086af-c803-4086-8ad4-958c4388b836_1125/website.components.code.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.code\" data-sqsp-block=\"code\" data-website-component-id=\"4d9a50d2f4e07373ab29\" id=\"block-4d9a50d2f4e07373ab29\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div\n  class=\"sqs-code-container\"\n  \n  \n    data-localized=\"{&quot;enableSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Preview in safe mode&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;This block contains embedded scripts. Embedded scripts are disabled while you're logged in and editing your site.&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Embedded Scripts&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Exit safe preview&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;Please view the page after logging out for accurate rendering.&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Safe Preview&quot;,&quot;globalSafeMode&quot;:&quot;Embedded Code: This block contains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\"\n  \n  \n  \n  \n>\n  \n    <img src=\"http://sp2018tnj6dwj.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/sagemas90community300x241_thumb.jpg\" title=\"sage-mas90-community-300x241\" alt=\"sage-mas90-community-300x241\"/>\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-border-radii=\"&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-e7124e950c7ab427150b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">It’s free and doesn’t require you to be on a current subscription plan. You don’t have to know you’re Sage account number or be on your company’s current contact list with Sage. You don’t even have to own MAS 90. Best of all many of the brightest Sage consultants and end users are frequently on there answering questions.2. The Sage Knowledgebase is currently available for free with no login required. I’m not sure I’m allowed to provide a direct link, but a quick Google <a href=\"http://www.google.com/#hl=en&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=X4KbTN-EMpOisAPZub2GBA&amp;sqi=2&amp;ved=0CBkQBSgA&amp;q=sage+infosource+knowledge+base&amp;spell=1&amp;fp=8b9dcbd6d27162f3&amp;cad=b\" target=\"_blank\">search</a> should reveal the way. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-code code-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/147086af-c803-4086-8ad4-958c4388b836_1125/website.components.code.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/147086af-c803-4086-8ad4-958c4388b836_1125/website.components.code.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.code\" data-sqsp-block=\"code\" data-website-component-id=\"9be35808b0f6fc722924\" id=\"block-9be35808b0f6fc722924\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div\n  class=\"sqs-code-container\"\n  \n  \n    data-localized=\"{&quot;enableSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Preview in safe mode&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;This block contains embedded scripts. Embedded scripts are disabled while you're logged in and editing your site.&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Embedded Scripts&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Exit safe preview&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;Please view the page after logging out for accurate rendering.&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Safe Preview&quot;,&quot;globalSafeMode&quot;:&quot;Embedded Code: This block contains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\"\n  \n  \n  \n  \n>\n  \n    <img src=\"http://sp2018tnj6dwj.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/sageknowledgebaselogin300x204_thumb.jpg\" title=\"sage-knowledgebase-login-300x204\" alt=\"sage-knowledgebase-login-300x204\"/>\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-border-radii=\"&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-57438f63f29759b3c677\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This is the same knowledgebase that consultants use to help support our end users. Sometimes Sage locks it behind a login which requires a current Sage MAS 90 / MAS 200 subscription, but for now it’s freely accessible. So take advantage of it.3. The Sage MAS 90 / MAS 200 help system built into MAS 90 and MAS 200. The online help built into the software itself often provides many answers. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-code code-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/147086af-c803-4086-8ad4-958c4388b836_1125/website.components.code.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/147086af-c803-4086-8ad4-958c4388b836_1125/website.components.code.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.code\" data-sqsp-block=\"code\" data-website-component-id=\"389fd3262ba20b2ef43e\" id=\"block-389fd3262ba20b2ef43e\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div\n  class=\"sqs-code-container\"\n  \n  \n    data-localized=\"{&quot;enableSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Preview in safe mode&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;This block contains embedded scripts. Embedded scripts are disabled while you're logged in and editing your site.&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Embedded Scripts&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Exit safe preview&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;Please view the page after logging out for accurate rendering.&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Safe Preview&quot;,&quot;globalSafeMode&quot;:&quot;Embedded Code: This block contains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\"\n  \n  \n  \n  \n>\n  \n    <img src=\"http://sp2018tnj6dwj.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/image_thumb1.png\" title=\"image\" alt=\"image\"/>\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-border-radii=\"&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-22e23e48c6d1e7cbf418\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">It’s not as good as having actual manuals, but it definitely contains a lot of good useful information.4. <a href=\"http://www.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Google</a> (or your favorite search engine) is another tool that can be helpful. I’d wager it’s even how you found this site. However there are many consultants with blogs and resources that have been made available without requiring subscriptions or logins. Additionally, I’d suggest checking out the <a href=\"http://www.90minds.com/\" target=\"_blank\">90 Minds website</a> for a listing of reseller websites that may contain helpful information. And of course check back here frequently for new and <a href=\"http://sp2018tnj6dwj.wpengine.com/\">exciting tips, tricks, and ideas</a>.5. Finally <a href=\"http://www.sageu.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sage University</a> while not free provides many courses both online and classroom based for reasonable fees. </p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-code code-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/147086af-c803-4086-8ad4-958c4388b836_1125/website.components.code.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.code/147086af-c803-4086-8ad4-958c4388b836_1125/website.components.code.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.code\" data-sqsp-block=\"code\" data-website-component-id=\"1d733f2503a7c06c7d01\" id=\"block-1d733f2503a7c06c7d01\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div\n  class=\"sqs-code-container\"\n  \n  \n    data-localized=\"{&quot;enableSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Preview in safe mode&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;This block contains embedded scripts. Embedded scripts are disabled while you're logged in and editing your site.&quot;,&quot;enableSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Embedded Scripts&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeButton&quot;:&quot;Exit safe preview&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeText&quot;:&quot;Please view the page after logging out for accurate rendering.&quot;,&quot;exitSafeModeTitle&quot;:&quot;Safe Preview&quot;,&quot;globalSafeMode&quot;:&quot;Embedded Code: This block contains embedded code that has been disabled.&quot;,&quot;scriptDisabled&quot;:&quot;Script Disabled&quot;}\"\n  \n  \n  \n  \n>\n  \n    <img src=\"http://sp2018tnj6dwj.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/sagesoftwareuniversity300x208_thumb.jpg\" title=\"sage-software-university-300x208\" alt=\"sage-software-university-300x208\"/>\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-border-radii=\"&#123;&quot;topLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;topRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomLeft&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;,&quot;bottomRight&quot;:&#123;&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:0.0&#125;&#125;\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-c8743b2e9f8db4689db6\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">While not tailored to your exact needs, these classes are usually cheaper than training from a consultant and the manuals that you get are often worth the price of the class.If none of these solutions provide you with the answers you seek, then feel free to <a href=\"http://sp2018tnj6dwj.wpengine.com/contact\" target=\"_blank\">contact us</a> for a quote to help you.via <a href=\"http://www.90minds.com/2010/09/23/mas90-free-support-options/\" target=\"_blank\">90 minds</a></p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
